  "body": "Enquiries Over $700,000 | CV $830,000\r\n\r\nModern, freehold and positioned in the heart of Browns Bay, this elevated two-bedroom home offers wide sea views, a private deck and effortless low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nProperty Documents: Copy and paste the link below into your browser, then scroll down:\r\nhttps://rwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG34276\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n-Zoned for Rangitoto College, Northcross Intermediate and Sherwood Primary\r\n- Freehold title\r\n- Two well-proportioned bedrooms\r\n- Modern kitchen with quality branded appliances\r\n- Open-plan living flowing seamlessly to the private deck\r\n- Double glazing and heat pump\r\n- High-stud ceilings enhance the sense of space and natural light  \r\n- Excellent built-in storage with multiple cupboards throughout\r\n- One dedicated car park\r\n- 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n- Residence Society levy of approximately $2,106.30 p.a., including insurance\r\n\r\nEnjoy exceptional convenience with Browns Bay shops, cafés, bus connections and local amenities all close by. The Northern Motorway, Albany Mall, Park & Ride, Massey University, Kristin and Pinehurst are also within easy reach.\r\n\r\nSet within a boutique development, this home is ideal for first-home buyers, busy professionals or investors seeking comfort, convenience and a well-connected coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nVacant and ready to move in-enquiries over $700,000 are invited. Secure it before Plan B begins!",
